{"id":"u08","level":"A1","emoji":"🛍️","title":{"t":"Einkaufen","s":"Shopping","a":"audio/de-en/efcbfaf74b43.mp3"},"goals":["Name clothes and colors","Ask for prices: Wie viel kostet …?","Use the accusative: den / einen","Point at things with dieser / diese / dieses"],"words":[{"id":"w01","t":"die Hose","pl":"die Hosen","s":"pants, trousers","emoji":"👖","ex":{"t":"Die Hose ist blau.","s":"The pants are blue.","a":"audio/de-en/c54a7a4c21ee.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f456.svg","a":"audio/de-en/6f7e043404b0.mp3","pla":"audio/de-en/e3564ddd1584.mp3"},{"id":"w02","t":"das Hemd","pl":"die Hemden","s":"shirt","emoji":"👔","ex":{"t":"Das Hemd kostet zwölf Euro.","s":"The shirt costs twelve euros.","a":"audio/de-en/4b5ac5956d41.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f454.svg","a":"audio/de-en/1dd523ee1682.mp3","pla":"audio/de-en/d5109e2592ac.mp3"},{"id":"w03","t":"das Kleid","pl":"die Kleider","s":"dress","emoji":"👗","ex":{"t":"Das Kleid ist rot.","s":"The dress is red.","a":"audio/de-en/e2797e592a24.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f457.svg","a":"audio/de-en/0024c3e6caaa.mp3","pla":"audio/de-en/ca1b8b8bd3cf.mp3"},{"id":"w04","t":"der Mantel","pl":"die Mäntel","s":"coat","emoji":"🧥","ex":{"t":"Der Mantel ist teuer.","s":"The coat is expensive.","a":"audio/de-en/7f05277492d7.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f9e5.svg","a":"audio/de-en/4855852187e6.mp3","pla":"audio/de-en/71fc16e03a55.mp3"},{"id":"w05","t":"der Schuh","pl":"die Schuhe","s":"shoe","emoji":"👞","ex":{"t":"Die Schuhe sind schwarz.","s":"The shoes are black.","a":"audio/de-en/a54e783677b4.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f45e.svg","a":"audio/de-en/f931f2e80022.mp3","pla":"audio/de-en/9af7677a3b3a.mp3"},{"id":"w06","t":"der Schal","pl":"die Schals","s":"scarf","emoji":"🧣","ex":{"t":"Ich möchte einen Schal.","s":"I'd like a scarf.","a":"audio/de-en/78a4005fd8ae.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f9e3.svg","a":"audio/de-en/be9e03acc19e.mp3","pla":"audio/de-en/291819d134ec.mp3"},{"id":"w07","t":"die Tasche","pl":"die Taschen","s":"bag","emoji":"👜","ex":{"t":"Die Tasche ist billig.","s":"The bag is cheap.","a":"audio/de-en/9332ea67c424.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f45c.svg","a":"audio/de-en/cc575cd728ba.mp3","pla":"audio/de-en/4d6d5a877153.mp3"},{"id":"w08","t":"rot","s":"red","emoji":"🔴","ex":{"t":"Mein Mantel ist rot.","s":"My coat is red.","a":"audio/de-en/67aafeb735d0.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f534.svg","a":"audio/de-en/1bc842899a6a.mp3"},{"id":"w09","t":"blau","s":"blue","emoji":"🔵","ex":{"t":"Mein Schal ist blau.","s":"My scarf is blue.","a":"audio/de-en/0c9d7fcb58d7.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f535.svg","a":"audio/de-en/b096ccbd2c0e.mp3"},{"id":"w10","t":"grün","s":"green","emoji":"🟢","ex":{"t":"Der Park ist grün.","s":"The park is green.","a":"audio/de-en/a3d74291fdf1.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f7e2.svg","a":"audio/de-en/8fdd81b130c5.mp3"},{"id":"w11","t":"schwarz","s":"black","emoji":"⚫","ex":{"t":"Die Tasche ist schwarz.","s":"The bag is black.","a":"audio/de-en/8356dbdf5a33.mp3"},"img":"img/e/26ab.svg","a":"audio/de-en/31aac65354bf.mp3"},{"id":"w12","t":"weiß","s":"white","emoji":"⚪","ex":{"t":"Das Hemd ist weiß.","s":"The shirt is white.","a":"audio/de-en/10c2f2790eba.mp3"},"img":"img/e/26aa.svg","a":"audio/de-en/fa6189de3fb8.mp3"},{"id":"w13","t":"teuer","s":"expensive","emoji":"💰","ex":{"t":"Das ist zu teuer!","s":"That's too expensive!","a":"audio/de-en/4c2294acb85d.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f4b0.svg","a":"audio/de-en/a57f2fb94e67.mp3"},{"id":"w14","t":"billig","s":"cheap","emoji":"","ex":{"t":"Die Schuhe sind billig.","s":"The shoes are cheap.","a":"audio/de-en/d88401df94b5.mp3"},"img":null,"a":"audio/de-en/82e7ade00c68.mp3"}],"phrases":[{"id":"p01","t":"Was möchten Sie?","s":"What would you like?","a":"audio/de-en/e4314ca6a9ba.mp3"},{"id":"p02","t":"Wie viel kostet die Hose?","s":"How much are the pants?","a":"audio/de-en/ca304375e9dc.mp3"},{"id":"p03","t":"Das kostet zwanzig Euro.","s":"That costs twenty euros.","a":"audio/de-en/0dea4e447648.mp3"},{"id":"p04","t":"Welche Farbe?","s":"What color?","a":"audio/de-en/a70f340f7e09.mp3"},{"id":"p05","t":"gelb, braun, grau","s":"yellow, brown, gray","a":"audio/de-en/a03531cc6f5e.mp3"},{"id":"p06","t":"Haben Sie das auch in Blau?","s":"Do you have that in blue too?","a":"audio/de-en/6fcee23df5cb.mp3"},{"id":"p07","t":"Ich nehme den Schal.","s":"I'll take the scarf.","a":"audio/de-en/f0e120dbd881.mp3"},{"id":"p08","t":"Das macht zwölf Euro.","s":"That comes to twelve euros.","a":"audio/de-en/9a2d22b7fb18.mp3"}],"dialogue":{"title":{"t":"Wie viel kostet der Schal?","s":"How much is the scarf?","a":"audio/de-en/f83bad09a4a3.mp3"},"speakers":{"A":{"name":"Verkäuferin","voice":"f"},"B":{"name":"Ali","voice":"m"}},"lines":[{"sp":"A","t":"Guten Tag! Was möchten Sie?","s":"Hello! What would you like?","a":"audio/de-en/5ca74e81ccdb.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Guten Tag! Ich möchte einen Schal.","s":"Hello! I'd like a scarf.","a":"audio/de-en/a35152d69031.mp3"},{"sp":"A","t":"Welche Farbe möchten Sie?","s":"What color would you like?","a":"audio/de-en/5f777c23501f.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Blau, bitte. Wie viel kostet dieser Schal?","s":"Blue, please. How much is this scarf?","a":"audio/de-en/874eb5929e45.mp3"},{"sp":"A","t":"Zwölf Euro.","s":"Twelve euros.","a":"audio/de-en/1f6943b72f15.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Das ist billig! Haben Sie auch Taschen?","s":"That's cheap! Do you have bags too?","a":"audio/de-en/d3a0c69b119c.mp3"},{"sp":"A","t":"Ja, hier. Diese Tasche kostet zwanzig Euro.","s":"Yes, here. This bag costs twenty euros.","a":"audio/de-en/368f31846683.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Hmm, das ist zu teuer. Ich nehme den Schal, bitte.","s":"Hmm, that's too expensive. I'll take the scarf, please.","a":"audio/de-en/02bd77c643ac.mp3"},{"sp":"A","t":"Gern! Das macht zwölf Euro.","s":"Sure! That comes to twelve euros.","a":"audio/de-en/738f5cf73fc5.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Hier, bitte. Vielen Dank!","s":"Here you are. Thank you very much!","a":"audio/de-en/15f679deb092.mp3"}]},"grammar":[{"id":"g01","title":{"t":"Ich nehme den Mantel.","s":"The accusative: den / einen"},"explain":"In **Ich nehme den Mantel**, the coat is the *object* – the thing you take, buy, want or have. Objects are in the **accusative** case.\nGood news: only **masculine** (der) words change! **der → den**, **ein → einen**, **kein → keinen**. Feminine, neuter and plural words stay the same.\nYou already know this from **Es gibt einen …**. It works the same way with **haben, möchten, kaufen, nehmen**: **Ich kaufe einen Schal.**\nThe table shows: the word → *the* (accusative) → *a* (accusative).\nNote: **nehmen** is irregular: ich nehme, du **nimmst**, er/sie **nimmt**.","table":[["der Mantel","den Mantel","einen Mantel"],["die Hose","die Hose","eine Hose"],["das Hemd","das Hemd","ein Hemd"],["die Schuhe","die Schuhe","Schuhe"]],"examples":[{"t":"Ich nehme den Mantel.","s":"I'll take the coat.","a":"audio/de-en/7078789b9088.mp3"},{"t":"Maryam kauft einen Schal.","s":"Maryam buys a scarf.","a":"audio/de-en/faee2054b19d.mp3"},{"t":"Ich möchte eine Tasche.","s":"I'd like a bag.","a":"audio/de-en/842337a342de.mp3"},{"t":"Ali hat keinen Mantel.","s":"Ali doesn't have a coat.","a":"audio/de-en/a59307843583.mp3"},{"t":"Wir kaufen das Kleid.","s":"We're buying the dress.","a":"audio/de-en/1c22f870baab.mp3"}],"exercises":[{"type":"choice","t":"Ich nehme ___ Mantel.","options":["der","den","das"],"answer":1,"s":"I'll take the coat.","full":"Ich nehme den Mantel.","a":"audio/de-en/7078789b9088.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"Sara kauft ___ Schal.","options":["ein","eine","einen"],"answer":2,"s":"Sara buys a scarf.","full":"Sara kauft einen Schal.","a":"audio/de-en/98735ecfa750.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"Ich möchte ___ Hose.","options":["die","den","das"],"answer":0,"s":"I'd like the pants.","full":"Ich möchte die Hose.","a":"audio/de-en/7e993baddf2f.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"Lukas hat ___ Mantel.","answer":["keinen"],"s":"Lukas doesn't have a coat.","full":"Lukas hat keinen Mantel.","a":"audio/de-en/eda309c3c026.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"Ich kaufe ___ Schal.","answer":["einen"],"s":"I'm buying a scarf.","full":"Ich kaufe einen Schal.","a":"audio/de-en/33f04521e8d7.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"Reza kauft ___ Schuhe.","options":["den","die","der"],"answer":1,"s":"Reza buys the shoes.","full":"Reza kauft die Schuhe.","a":"audio/de-en/c2b5b88d6123.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"Wir nehmen ___ Hemd.","answer":["das"],"s":"We'll take the shirt.","full":"Wir nehmen das Hemd.","a":"audio/de-en/9a503919825c.mp3"},{"type":"order","t":"Ich nehme den Schal.","s":"I'll take the scarf.","full":"Ich nehme den Schal.","a":"audio/de-en/f0e120dbd881.mp3"}]},{"id":"g02","title":{"t":"Wie viel kostet dieser Mantel?","s":"this: dieser / diese / dieses"},"explain":"To point at something – *this* coat, *this* bag – use **dieser**. The ending matches the article: **der → dieser**, **die → diese**, **das → dieses**, plural **die → diese**.\nIn the accusative, masculine changes again, just like **den**: **Ich nehme diesen Mantel.**\nTo ask the price, say **Wie viel kostet …?** for one thing and **Wie viel kosten …?** for more than one: **Wie viel kosten diese Schuhe?**\nThe table shows: the word → *this* → *this* (accusative).","table":[["der Mantel","dieser Mantel","diesen Mantel"],["die Tasche","diese Tasche","diese Tasche"],["das Kleid","dieses Kleid","dieses Kleid"],["die Schuhe","diese Schuhe","diese Schuhe"]],"examples":[{"t":"Wie viel kostet dieser Schal?","s":"How much is this scarf?","a":"audio/de-en/a2134f467c8c.mp3"},{"t":"Diese Tasche ist schwarz.","s":"This bag is black.","a":"audio/de-en/910288abaf53.mp3"},{"t":"Dieses Kleid kostet zwanzig Euro.","s":"This dress costs twenty euros.","a":"audio/de-en/1a65b64c9a22.mp3"},{"t":"Ich nehme diesen Mantel.","s":"I'll take this coat.","a":"audio/de-en/e1b4e8ae1967.mp3"},{"t":"Wie viel kosten diese Schuhe?","s":"How much are these shoes?","a":"audio/de-en/ed19415c3ea4.mp3"}],"exercises":[{"type":"choice","t":"___ Hemd ist weiß.","options":["Dieser","Diese","Dieses"],"answer":2,"s":"This shirt is white.","full":"Dieses Hemd ist weiß.","a":"audio/de-en/d288e2f0573d.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"Wie viel kostet ___ Tasche?","options":["diese","dieser","dieses"],"answer":0,"s":"How much is this bag?","full":"Wie viel kostet diese Tasche?","a":"audio/de-en/507e9995b75d.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"Ich nehme ___ Schal.","options":["dieser","diesen","dieses"],"answer":1,"s":"I'll take this scarf.","full":"Ich nehme diesen Schal.","a":"audio/de-en/9796e002a96a.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"Wie viel ___ diese Schuhe?","options":["kostet","kostest","kosten"],"answer":2,"s":"How much are these shoes?","full":"Wie viel kosten diese Schuhe?","a":"audio/de-en/ed19415c3ea4.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"___ Mantel ist teuer.","answer":["Dieser"],"s":"This coat is expensive.","full":"Dieser Mantel ist teuer.","a":"audio/de-en/f54407949466.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"Das Kleid ___ fünfzehn Euro.","answer":["kostet"],"s":"The dress costs fifteen euros.","full":"Das Kleid kostet fünfzehn Euro.","a":"audio/de-en/7ab2139a58f4.mp3"},{"type":"order","t":"Wie viel kostet dieses Kleid?","s":"How much is this dress?","full":"Wie viel kostet dieses Kleid?","a":"audio/de-en/01a103c1c5b3.mp3"}]}],"reading":{"title":{"t":"Sara kauft ein","s":"Sara goes shopping","a":"audio/de-en/dbe224ff6e13.mp3"},"text":[{"t":"Sara ist in der Stadt und kauft ein.","s":"Sara is in town, shopping.","a":"audio/de-en/031380573ef9.mp3"},{"t":"Sie möchte ein Kleid und eine Tasche.","s":"She'd like a dress and a bag.","a":"audio/de-en/70acfb853ca4.mp3"},{"t":"Dieses Kleid ist grün und kostet achtzehn Euro.","s":"This dress is green and costs eighteen euros.","a":"audio/de-en/ca8f50ec92a4.mp3"},{"t":"Das ist nicht teuer. Sara nimmt das Kleid.","s":"That isn't expensive. Sara takes the dress.","a":"audio/de-en/13a7e63e5f73.mp3"},{"t":"Die Tasche ist schwarz und kostet zwanzig Euro.","s":"The bag is black and costs twenty euros.","a":"audio/de-en/ceb4241d3dc4.mp3"},{"t":"Das ist zu teuer!","s":"That's too expensive!","a":"audio/de-en/4c2294acb85d.mp3"},{"t":"Sara kauft keine Tasche, aber sie nimmt einen Schal.","s":"Sara doesn't buy a bag, but she takes a scarf.","a":"audio/de-en/cc38df8efcad.mp3"},{"t":"Der Schal ist weiß und billig.","s":"The scarf is white and cheap.","a":"audio/de-en/c4c9774f2d47.mp3"}],"questions":[{"q":{"t":"Welche Farbe hat das Kleid?","s":"What color is the dress?","a":"audio/de-en/4304ab4d3272.mp3"},"options":["rot","grün","schwarz"],"answer":1},{"q":{"t":"Wie viel kostet die Tasche?","s":"How much is the bag?","a":"audio/de-en/4a558e179e12.mp3"},"options":["achtzehn Euro","zehn Euro","zwanzig Euro"],"answer":2},{"q":{"t":"Was kauft Sara?","s":"What does Sara buy?","a":"audio/de-en/35f886e11380.mp3"},"options":["ein Kleid und einen Schal","ein Kleid und eine Tasche","eine Tasche und einen Schal"],"answer":0},{"q":{"t":"Wie ist der Schal?","s":"What is the scarf like?","a":"audio/de-en/15003ad49b03.mp3"},"options":["schwarz und teuer","weiß und billig","grün und billig"],"answer":1}]},"sentences":[{"t":"Wie viel kostet diese Hose?","s":"How much are these pants?","a":"audio/de-en/2dd6869c8fc7.mp3"},{"t":"Das kostet neun Euro fünfzig.","s":"That costs nine euros fifty.","a":"audio/de-en/110d36d0e71c.mp3"},{"t":"Ich nehme den Mantel.","s":"I'll take the coat.","a":"audio/de-en/7078789b9088.mp3"},{"t":"Haben Sie das auch in Rot?","s":"Do you have that in red too?","a":"audio/de-en/0e203384de51.mp3"},{"t":"Maryam kauft einen Schal.","s":"Maryam buys a scarf.","a":"audio/de-en/faee2054b19d.mp3"},{"t":"Dieses Hemd ist zu teuer.","s":"This shirt is too expensive.","a":"audio/de-en/cfad4ed27e11.mp3"},{"t":"Ich möchte eine Hose, bitte.","s":"I'd like a pair of pants, please.","a":"audio/de-en/22a6197c355b.mp3"},{"t":"Die Schuhe sind weiß.","s":"The shoes are white.","a":"audio/de-en/6437b8a970eb.mp3"}],"img":"img/e/1f6cd.svg"}